; Travel Calendar Test Fixture
;
;   Minimal ICS feed for unit tests: one all-day Chicago trip overlapping next week
;   when as_of = 2026-05-18 (used by calendar and travel module tests).
;
; INPUT:
;   - Parsed as raw ICS string (include_str! in tests).
;
; OUTPUT:
;   - One VEVENT: SUMMARY "Chicago, IL", DTSTART 2026-05-26, DTEND 2026-05-30 (exclusive).
;
; NOTES:
;   - Comment lines are ignored by the Pepper ICS parser (skipped outside VEVENT blocks).
;
; Written by Cursor for Ready Mouse and Pepper CRM. May 2026. All rights reserved.

BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Pepper CRM//Travel Test//EN
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:travel-test-chicago@pepper
SUMMARY:Chicago, IL
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260526
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260530
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
